{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"id":"GnuPG.GnuPG","latestVersion":"2.5.24","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"GNU Privacy Guard (GnuPG or GPG) is a free-software replacement for Symantec's PGP cryptographic software suite.","license":"GPLv3","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"GNU Privacy Guard (GnuPG or GPG) is a free-software replacement for Symantec's PGP cryptographic software suite.","license":"GPLv3","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"GnuPG is a complete and free implementation of the OpenPGP standard as defined by RFC4880 (also known as PGP). GnuPG allows you to encrypt and sign your data and communications; it features a versatile key management system, along with access modules for all kinds of public key directories. GnuPG, also known as GPG, is a command line tool with features for easy integration with other applications. A wealth of frontend applications and libraries are available. It also provides support for S/MIME and Secure Shell (ssh).","moniker":"gnupg","name":"GNU Privacy Guard","packageUrl":"https://gnupg.org/","publisher":"The GnuPG Project","publisherUrl":"https://gnupg.org/","tags":["cryptography","encrypt","encryption","gnupg","gpg","pgp","privacy","s/mime","security","sign","signature","x.509"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"GNU Privacy Guard（GnuPG 或 GPG）是赛门铁克 PGP 密码软件套件的免费替代软件。","license":"GPL-3.0","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"GnuPG 是 RFC4880 定义的 OpenPGP 标准（又称 PGP）的完整免费/自由实现。GnuPG 允许你对数据和通信进行加密和签名；它拥有一个多功能密钥管理系统，以及各种公共密钥目录的访问模块。GnuPG 又称 GPG，是一种命令行工具，具有与其他应用程序轻松集成的功能，并且有大量的前端应用程序和库可供使用。GnuPG 还支持 S/MIME 和安全 Shell (ssh)。","name":"GNU Privacy Guard","packageUrl":"https://gnupg.org/","publisher":"The GnuPG Project","publisherUrl":"https://gnupg.org/","tags":["gnupg","gpg","pgp","s/mime","x.509","加密","安全","密码学","签名","隐私"]}},"longDescription":"GnuPG is a complete and free implementation of the OpenPGP standard as defined by RFC4880 (also known as PGP). GnuPG allows you to encrypt and sign your data and communications; it features a versatile key management system, along with access modules for all kinds of public key directories. GnuPG, also known as GPG, is a command line tool with features for easy integration with other applications. A wealth of frontend applications and libraries are available. It also provides support for S/MIME and Secure Shell (ssh).","moniker":"gnupg","name":"GNU Privacy Guard","packageUrl":"https://gnupg.org/","publisher":"The GnuPG Project","publisherUrl":"https://gnupg.org/","tags":["cryptography","encrypt","encryption","gnupg","gpg","pgp","privacy","s/mime","security","sign","signature","x.509"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/2.5.24/app.json","detailSha256":"5ab33faabe6ec5cfe7c302e75f559a3d6579e99c837a3c63395b024912f2c043","releaseDate":"2026-09-23","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"2.5.24"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/2.5.22/app.json","detailSha256":"8a9c77ac09dbfaaf560a04dd1db01d5969169d4bd90cd062c1ac59fb24d36db8","releaseDate":"2026-08-31","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"2.5.22"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/2.5.21/app.json","detailSha256":"a45053da7eb5ccdc907a0d9efcc22733d3b579bf59c9f89d71c7c1b5bd9a57f7","releaseDate":"2026-07-02","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"2.5.21"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/2.5.20/app.json","detailSha256":"022d74c80690659420b0d2916a70674c76b3e24f7ef19c1ffb7594440809f9e0","releaseDate":"2026-05-13","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"2.5.20"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/2.5.19/app.json","detailSha256":"7d6d39f60585f71bed7cff23fc90878e6c7996e357e1748252cedf3e876e8292","releaseDate":"2026-04-24","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"2.5.19"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/2.5.18/app.json","detailSha256":"c13b3ae5cc34d71dbc7eeb7af16cd7fb800897a96335b8f21f04dbfec2142490","releaseDate":"2026-02-24","release